-- The first creator cards the team made itself: the creators on its shared
-- "Buddhist Creators Around the World" sheet, one card each. They replace
-- the list of names the People page used to carry in code.
--
-- Every card is approved as it is made and belongs to nobody (user_id is
-- null) until its creator claims it. What the sheet does not have is left
-- empty. A link is here only where the profile the sheet names was found,
-- with a follower count that agrees with the sheet's; the photo is that
-- profile's own picture, stored in the bucket under
-- creator-cards/profile-pictures/. Names and one-liners are the sheet's
-- with their spelling tidied.
INSERT INTO "creator_cards" ("status", "reviewed_at", "display_name", "country", "tagline", "photo_key", "socials", "youtube_followers", "instagram_followers", "facebook_followers")
